{"id":1776626,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-23T15:41:38.996Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/qXdduKJ8XbAQqnDgbSvHSsfsShh.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":1000,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1776626,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Scorpio: A Flim by Angel Dweh","overview":"Angel Dweh left Liberia for Pennsylvania as a child. Over the following decade he builds a music career entirely on his own terms — his own label, his own sound, his own rooms — releasing three EPs that move from introduction, to confession, to something stripped bare.  The film traces the sound back further than he does. A century earlier, Kru sailors from the Liberian coast worked European ships as free crew and came home with guitars, playing them in a two-finger style that travelled port to port and became the foundation of West African popular music.  Across conversations with Dweh and the people who record him, a portrait emerges of an artist who keeps his life private and reveals himself only through lyrics and, having made it somewhere new, turns back toward the country he came from.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/gjaJyLki6W8eJAo6ntV5gocPvQH.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":311809,"logo_path":null,"name":"Lake Village Music LLC","origin_country":""},{"id":311810,"logo_path":null,"name":"415eastrecording","origin_country":""},{"id":311811,"logo_path":null,"name":"Independent Artist","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","name":"United States of America"}],"release_date":"2026-09-04","revenue":0,"runtime":66,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Scorpio: A Flim by Angel Dweh","video":true,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"external_ids":{"imdb_id":null,"wikidata_id":null,"facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"k